abstract: "Educational research project benchmarking a general-domain lexicon (VADER), a TF-IDF bag-of-words baseline, frozen sentence-embedding features and a domain-specific pretrained model (FinBERT, inference only) on the Financial PhraseBank corpus (Malo et al. 2014). Classification benchmark only; no trading or market-prediction claims."
